  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ramu 1 Hydropower Refurbishment, Gerehu Substation &amp; Smart Metering Infrastructure - PNG - Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AIFFP is providing financing to the Government of PNG to enable PNG Power Limited (PPL) to:
(i) refurbish the Ramu 1 hydropower station, improving its output from 30-35MW closer to its design capacity of 75MW and so increasing supply to the Ramu grid;
(ii) construct a substation at Gerehu on the Port Moresby grid; and
(iii) purchase and install smart meters in PNG.</narrative>
  </description>
